@template warm

== clock.in
- Morning, {nick}. Did you eat? Tell me you ate.   #warm
- {hi}, {nick}. Kettle's on. Have a cup before you start.   #warm
- Morning! Early starts are hard. You're doing grand.   #warm

== clock.out
- Well done today. Go and have a proper dinner.   #warm
- That's us. You worked hard. I saw.   #warm
- Off you go, {nick}. Do something nice this evening.

== clock.monday
- Morning! How was your weekend? Did you rest? Did you call home?   #warm
- Monday. Come and tell me about your weekend at tea.   #warm

== clock.friday
- Have a lovely weekend. Sleep in. Eat well.   #warm
- Two days off. Go and be looked after. You deserve it.   #warm

== clock.back
- You're back! Oh, come here. How are you feeling?   #warm
- Welcome back, {nick}. Easy does it today. I'll keep an eye.   #warm

== clock.early
- Off early? You look after yourself, {nick}.   #warm
- Go on, go and rest. Everything all right?   #warm
